"The Ace of Spades" <julianwaldby@comcast.net> writes:

> Yes, I'm curious how you can determine when you suffer from the ring hunger.
> Do you need to observe a change in satiation status to do this?

No, it's turn based.  Every N*20 + 4th turn you're charged 
for the left hand ring, every N*20 + 12th turn for the 
right hand ring.  By putting rings on and off you can 
guarantee that 

a) on each turn, you wear at least one =osD,

b) on the critical turns, the corresponding hand 
   is ring-free, hence no food consumption takes place.  

For instance, one could use the following scheme: 
Start with left hand ring (LHR) put on.  

Turn            Action

N*20 + 2        Put on right hand ring (RHR)
N*20 + 3        Remove left hand ring (LHR)
N*20 + 10       Put on LHR
N*20 + 11       Remove RHR

N -> N+1 and so on.  

